# User journey — v1.0 Execution Mode

**Authoritative specs:** `docs/user-experience.md`, `docs/ship-timeline.md`, `docs/frozen-shell.md`, `docs/visual-checklist.md`, `docs/deferred.md`.

## The single rule

The shell is frozen on Day 1. The golden path test decides done. Everything else goes to `docs/deferred.md`.

## What to build

Only code that advances the **Golden Path** in `docs/user-experience.md`:

1. Main document + orchestrator command bar
2. Multi-model side-by-side staging with **visual diff** (`ast_diff.py`)
3. Hybrid merge into Main document (TipTap `insertContentAt`)
4. Red-Hat (≥2 passes)
5. Grammar/flow revision on Main
6. Full-context scan, benchmark, targeted rewrite
7. Export dossier

**Technical order:** Orchestrator Celery task → diff UI → click-to-merge. See `docs/user-experience.md` § Technical path.

## What NOT to do

- Do **not** change the 3-pane grid (`48px | 320px | 1fr | drawer`) during Sprints 1–3.
- Do **not** fix visual polish mid-sprint — log in `docs/deferred.md`.
- Do **not** add features not on the golden path — log in `docs/deferred.md`.
- Do **not** expect Cursor to make product or ship decisions.

## Bug triage

| Type | Action |
| --- | --- |
| Layout break (resize, rail width, pane overlap) | Fix immediately — screenshot + prompt |
| Functional golden-path failure | Fix immediately |
| Visual / copy / nice-to-have | `docs/deferred.md` — batch in Days 22–24 |
| Scope request | `docs/deferred.md` — no exceptions |

## Human vs AI

| Cursor | Human (product owner) |
| --- | --- |
| Functional code | v1.0 scope decisions |
| Tests for golden path | Visual acceptance (screenshots) |
| Diff engine, merge, APIs | Copy approval (read aloud) |
| | ICP demo, ship/rollback calls |

## Sprint gates

Refer to `docs/ship-timeline.md`. If Day 7 slips, cut Sprint 1 scope — do not move Day 14.

## Visual standard

Executive-grade criteria live in `docs/visual-checklist.md`. Apply only during Convergence (Days 22–24).
